{"summary": "規劃節拍的單發腦函數：工作區 new/<n>.json 是稿紙（第 2 次附 plan_lint 的理由），問腦一次，答案 out/<n>.txt 是 beat 表 JSON（每拍誰、做什麼、帶哪個關鍵詞）；同一個 stack 再叫＝接著上一張表聊",
 "time_ms": {"val": 6000, "max": 150000},
 "resource": ["llm", "cpu"],
 "llm_calls": {"val": 1, "max": 1},
 "llm_tokens": {"val": 1800, "max": 4000},
 "llm_endpoint": "http://localhost:4000/v1",
 "llm_model": "chatgpt-gpt-6-luna-low",
 "side_effect": true,
 "idempotent": false,
 "deterministic": false,
 "interrupt": "safe",
 "parallel": true,
 "lock": [{"$env": "AOS_STACK", "$prefix": "stack:"}],
 "reads": ["$AOS_WS/new/*.json", "$AOS_WS/cur/*.json", "$AOS_STACK/history.jsonl", "system.txt"],
 "writes": ["$AOS_WS/out/<n>.txt", "$AOS_WS/done/", "$AOS_STACK/{history.jsonl,current.txt,llm.jsonl}"],
 "grow_level": 4,
 "shape": "單發腦函數（_entry 單子＋ask.py；round3 由 loop→fsm idle→think→act 收攏）",
 "tier": "galtxt 五層的 L1／L2（場景規劃、beat 展開）"}
